<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<hack name="Fans [#96 - #99]" author="Enlight">
    <panel>
		<panel>
			<field type="info">
				This patch allows you to modify the Fans found in Grasstown. Entities 96 through 99.
				REMINDER: They need to have "alternate direction" set to spawn activated (aka direction 0002).
				The default force value is "136". Negative numbers work.
				Setting it to zero has some weird frictionless behavior when quote is on the floor.
			</field>
			<field type="label">Another note: Fans can't override player max speed, which is editable with the hack:</field>
			<field type="label">"/player properties/boosteracceleration_and_maxspeed.xml"</field>
		</panel>
		<panel>
			<panel title="Fan(Up) #97">
				<field type="label">Force on Quote:</field>
				<field type="text" size="4" offset="0x43AEE8" />
			</panel>
		</panel>
		<panel>
